      "y": 275,
      "width": 210,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 阶段 2｜Trainer 与角色\n- actor_rollout_wg\n- critic_wg\n- ref_policy_wg\n- init_workers() / init_model()",
